A picture for the [[poolside-style|Poolside style]]: clear cyan-to-blue water over a pale tile floor, two orange lane ropes and a blue one, a striped life ring, orange buoys with white dots, bubbles and a small sun on the deck. The orange stays crisp and solid, and never blends into the water. Drawn as a vector image, so it stays sharp at any size!
